From c034b975eb3c0fd52dd918ac109b6db968151892 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "gastown.slit (polecat)" <polecat-gastown.slit@soundit.local>
Date: Wed, 8 Jul 2026 23:45:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: client portal product shop (catalog + orders)
 (psa-qq1)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adds a self-service product catalog ("Shop") to the client portal so contacts
can order hardware/services beyond prepaid time (GitHub #156). Generalizes the
existing portal prepaid-purchase flow to an arbitrary multi-item order.

What it does:
- SKUs gain a `portal_orderable` flag (+ optional client-friendly
  `portal_description`); staff publish products to the catalog from the SKU
  form. `Sku::scopePortalOrderable()` = active AND orderable.
- New opt-in `portal_shop_enabled` setting (PortalConfig::shopEnabled(),
  default off), toggled in Settings > Integrations > Client Portal. A "Shop"
  nav item appears in the portal only when enabled.
- PortalOrderController: catalog (grouped by category, JS live total) →
  multi-item store (per-line TOCTOU price guard, live-catalog resolution,
  duplicate-order guard) → confirmation with billing-backend payment link
  + polling.
- PortalOrderService::createOrderInvoice() materializes the order as a single
  Posted invoice (one line per product, contract_id null — a catalog purchase
  is not contract-scoped). subtotal == total locally; tax is calculated by the
  billing backend (Stripe/QBO) on push, mirroring the prepay flow. Push runs
  via app()->terminating(); staff are notified via a new
  NotificationEventType::PortalProductOrder event.

Design notes:
- The invoice IS the order record (no separate Order model), matching the
  established prepaid-purchase pattern; contract_id null follows the existing
  imported-invoice precedent.
- The "configurator" is delivered as a quantity-configurable multi-item order
  form; a richer component-level configurator can be a follow-up.

Tests: tests/Feature/Portal/PortalShopTest.php (gating, catalog visibility,
order→invoice totals/margin, TOCTOU + validation guards, duplicate guard,
staff notification, confirmation authz) and tests/Feature/Sku/
SkuPortalFieldsTest.php (staff form persistence). Full gc-verify green
(2583 passed, Pint, secret guard). Docs: INSTALL.md + CLAUDE.md updated.
