Self-review touch-ups that landed after the initial commit's staging:
- PortalOrderController duplicate-order guard now matches the order note by
  exact equality instead of a LIKE without wildcards, so a contact name
  containing SQL wildcard characters can't perturb the dedup lookup.
- Adds test_duplicate_order_within_window_reuses_invoice covering that guard
  (second identical submit routes to the existing order, no second invoice).

Both were exercised by the green gc-verify run (working-tree state); this
commit captures them so the branch tip matches what was verified.
